---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="What we do" description="Our process: representative sampling, AI voice agents, and MRP models that turn thousands of real conversations into population-level insight.">

  
  <section class="container-site pt-14 md:pt-20 pb-8">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Our Process</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] max-w-4xl">
      We use AI to understand people &mdash; not just what they believe, but <em>why</em>.
    </h1>
    <p class="prose-body mt-6 max-w-2xl">
      Every interview is guided by empathy, depth, and respect for cultural nuance.
    </p>
  </section>

  
  <section class="container-site pb-16">
    <img
      src="/images/what-we-do-overhead.jpg"
      alt="Overhead view of two professionals at work"
      class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_30px_80px_-40px_rgba(30,20,10,0.4)]"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </section>

  
  <section class="container-site pb-10">
    <div class="grid gap-16 md:gap-20">

      <article class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <p class="font-serif text-[44px] leading-none text-terracotta/80">01</p>
          <p class="eyebrow mt-2">Sampling</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2rem)] leading-tight mb-4">
            Representative sampling from trusted data
          </h2>
          <p class="prose-body">
            We build samples from the highest-quality voter file and demographic data available,
            designed to capture variation across geography, race, age, education, language, and
            partisanship &mdash; not just nationally, but down to the communities that matter for
            your specific questions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <p class="font-serif text-[44px] leading-none text-terracotta/80">02</p>
          <p class="eyebrow mt-2">Interviews</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2rem)] leading-tight mb-4">
            AI voice agents, real phone calls
          </h2>
          <p class="prose-body">
            Our AI voice agents place live phone calls and conduct semi-structured interviews.
            They listen, follow up, probe deeper &mdash; adapting in real time to what the respondent
            says. These aren&rsquo;t robocalls or scripted surveys. They&rsquo;re genuine conversations,
            conducted in the respondent&rsquo;s preferred language, that surface the reasoning and
            emotion behind people&rsquo;s views.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <p class="font-serif text-[44px] leading-none text-terracotta/80">03</p>
          <p class="eyebrow mt-2">Estimates</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2rem)] leading-tight mb-4">
            From transcripts to estimates: MRP at scale
          </h2>
          <p class="prose-body">
            Every interview produces a full transcript. We extract themes, sentiment, and
            reasoning patterns using large language models, then combine these with respondent
            demographics in multilevel regression and poststratification (MRP) models. The result:
            population-representative estimates of attitudes, beliefs, and issue priorities &mdash;
            broken out by geography, demography, and voter segments &mdash; from a method that captures
            why people think what they think, not just which box they&rsquo;d check.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="container-site mt-20">
    <div class="border-t border-fog/40 pt-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="font-serif text-[22px] text-ink">Want to see it in action?</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
